OL,3,GNEWSADaniel Thomas faces trial in 2027
OL,4,Aover migrant site accusations
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-migrant activist Daniel Thomas
OL,7,Fwill stand trial next year over claims
OL,8,Fhe entered a restricted zone at a
OL,9,Fmigrant processing centre in Dover.
OL,11,FThomas, 37, known to his supporters as
OL,12,FDanny Tommo, denies the charges linked
OL,13,Fto the alleged incident at Western Jet
OL,14,FFoil in Dover on 31 March.
OL,16,FAppearing at Westminster Magistrates'
OL,17,FCourt via video link on Wednesday, he
OL,18,Fwas told he is due to stand trial at
OL,19,Fthe same court from 1 June.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
